Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 18:25:43 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1090/1177] The Librarian's light: the top left 40 % softer,
 the sweep 10 % further (1118)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css      |   3 ++-
 tools/public/index.html.gz | Bin 466255 -> 466315 bytes
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 40c1d8e..69b519c 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -3096,7 +3096,8 @@ input[type="search"]::-webkit-search-cancel-button { cursor: pointer; }
    the top left (where the room's heading wash begins) and fading to the panel; the cards are windows onto it, the
    ground between them untouched. A state (hover, checked, the take in the player) is a tint laid over the window,
    not a second light. Where a browser does not fix backgrounds (phones), each card shows the whole sweep. */
-:root { --coll-light: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--tone-3) 0%, var(--tone-1) 42%, var(--panel) 82%); }
+:root { --coll-light: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in oklab, var(--amber) 8.4%, var(--panel)) 0%, var(--tone-1) 52%, var(--panel) 92%); }
+/* (Viktor, 02.10: the top-left point 40 % less rich, the sweep 10 % further toward the bottom right) */
 .coll-card { background: var(--coll-light); background-attachment: fixed; }
 .coll-card:hover { background: linear-gradient(color-mix(in oklab, var(--amber) 4%, transparent), color-mix(in oklab, var(--amber) 4%, transparent)), var(--coll-light); background-attachment: scroll, fixed; }
 .coll-card.is-current { background: linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in oklab, var(--amber) 8%, transparent), transparent 85%), var(--coll-light); background-attachment: scroll, fixed; }
